**/bin/
**/obj/
# dotnet-ef on Linux leaves literal "bin\Debug" directories (backslash in the name) that
# **/bin/ does not match — they break MSBuild's resx globs (MSB3552) inside the image.
**/bin\\Debug/
**/obj\\Debug/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.git/
**/data/
**/audio/
**/spool/
**/models/
*.md
.claude/
